{"name": "Outpour", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play as a Gargoyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outpour is a serene block-pushing puzzle game where <strong>living water responds to your every interaction</strong>. As a gargoyle, find inner peace by mastering the water's flow and channeling it safely away from the cathedral walls, fulfilling your duty to protect your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control the Flow of Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Water flows throughout via a <strong>dynamic grid-based system</strong>. It's familiar and intuitive, yet full of unexpected complexities and revelations. Manipulate your surroundings to direct the flow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c939d108503f9565a7daf81885d1ed89.poster.avif?t=1787305550\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c939d108503f9565a7daf81885d1ed89.webm?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c939d108503f9565a7daf81885d1ed89.mp4?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Clever Ways to Move About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push blocks, pull them from afar, tip scales, climb around, sail a gondola, and make a splash!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/66bb408d1c0fdcfa0d4b4f028432a767.poster.avif?t=1787305550\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/66bb408d1c0fdcfa0d4b4f028432a767.webm?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/66bb408d1c0fdcfa0d4b4f028432a767.mp4?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Cozy and Intimate Sanctuaries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy relaxing atmospheres whether you're solving puzzles above the clouds or seeking refuge inside a well lit space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve over <strong>200 unique hand-crafted puzzles</strong> across various environments in this introspective journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c4a8305bb9bfc7f183ca9636d41514de.poster.avif?t=1787305550\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c4a8305bb9bfc7f183ca9636d41514de.webm?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/extras/c4a8305bb9bfc7f183ca9636d41514de.mp4?t=1787305550\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Outpour is a puzzle game where you redirect flowing water across dreamy cathedral rooftops. Manipulate your surroundings to guide a dynamic water system, traverse high places, and restore harmony to sacred structures.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615290/79235ae2de681f7a1b1e701bc0596467c22fc51a/header.jpg?t=1787305550", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Sokoban", "Indie", "3D", "Singleplayer", "Adventure"], "developers": "Andrew Leal", "publishers": "Andrew Leal", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3615290", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/yb_FskoPiiI", "first_seen": 1779926400.0}